2026-10-31T00:00:11Z (RFD66606-2391) 'Check: `tools/probe_load.gd` loads `lasso.elf` (seven PASS lines with their controls) and asserts `OS.has_feature("double")` implies `variant_bytes() == 40` for curvenet and lasso. Xtools/test.sh` and the replay pass on the double editor and template builds in CI on linux x86_64 and on the Frame through `run-xr.sh`. Control: `--control=single_elf` loads a committed single-precision `curvenet.elf` and must print `RESULT: FAIL`. A Mojo guest built to name 24 bytes is refused by the double host with "this program's Variant is 24 bytes, and this build's is 40". `linux.yml` gains `feat/*` and stays as the single-precision arm.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2391  1 LINE
 Text:Written

